{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108071","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108071/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108071/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108071/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108071","id":3184780228,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc690-PE","number":108071,"title":"Setting rotation to PI is not equal to PI","user":{"login":"Logharn","id":112166548,"node_id":"U_kgDOBq-GlA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/112166548?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Logharn","html_url":"https://github.com/Logharn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Logharn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Logharn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Logharn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Logharn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Logharn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Logharn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Logharn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Logharn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Logharn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":4,"created_at":"2025-06-28T09:35:22Z","updated_at":"2025-06-28T14:09:38Z","closed_at":"2025-06-28T13:35:24Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in: 4.4.1.stable\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 11 - Godot Engine v4.4.1.stable.official.49a5bc7b6 - https://godotengine.org Vulkan 1.4.303 - Forward+ - Using Device #0: NVIDIA - NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4060 Ti\n\n### Issue description\n\nSetting the rotation of a node to PI, is then approximated to a bit more than PI.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nCreate a new project.\nCreate a Sprite2D node.\nAdd \"icon.svg\" as texture of Sprite2D.\nAdd a Timer as child of Sprite2D.\nAttach a new script to Sprite2D.\nFill it with this code:\n\n```gdscript\nextends Sprite2D\n\n# Called when the node enters the scene tree for the first time.\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\t$Timer.timeout.connect(on_timer_timeout)\n\tself.rotation = 0\n\nfunc on_timer_timeout() -> void:\n\tprint(self.rotation)\n\tself.rotation += PI\n\n\tif self.rotation >= TAU:\n\t\tprint(PI)\n\t\trotation = 0\n```\n\nThe console Output will be:\n\n0.0\n3.14159274101257\n3.14159265358979\n0.0\n3.14159274101257\n3.14159265358979\n...\n\nIn the inspector the rotation is reported correctly as 180.0° because it is rounded but in code is 180.000005008956\n\n\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nReady made project\n\n[rotation_test.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/20959856/rotation_test.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":